SAU","lat":25.42905,"lon":49.56591,"kind":"city","region":"SA-04","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159128287","name":"盖提夫","country":"SAU","lat":26.51963,"lon":50.01151,"kind":"city","region":"SA-04","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"盖提夫 · 地点概要","geo":"盖提夫是沙地阿拉伯东部省的城市，位于达曼以北20公里的波斯湾海岸，是国内最重要的农业和捕渔业地区中心，橄榄树在肥沃的土地上生长，居民多数是农民、渔民或从事石油业。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q847660","articleTitle":"卡提夫","sourceRevision":91102615,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 卡提夫","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%A4%AB"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91102615"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q847660"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159128295","name":"宰赫兰","country":"SAU","lat":26.29143,"lon":50.15832,"kind":"city","region":"SA-04","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"宰赫兰 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"宰赫兰（阿拉伯语 الظهران aẓ-Ẓahrān）位于沙特阿拉伯东部省达曼市郊，是沙乌地阿拉伯石油工业的重要中心。\n宰赫兰位于达曼市南部约15公里，他们同属都阿拉伯湾海岸古老的港口城市之一；其东面是岛国巴林。\n宰赫兰的气候特点是极端酷热、潮湿的夏季和凉爽的冬季。","culture":"达兰市位处于沙漠地上，多山多石，也是沙特阿拉伯最早建立的油井的所在地，所在地现为阿卜杜勒阿齐兹国王世界文化中心。\n1931年，首次在达兰地区发现石油储备，美国加利福尼亚标准石油公司（即现时的雪佛龙公司）建了第一口商业用油井，更建立了沙乌地阿拉伯分公司，名为「阿拉伯美国石油公司（ARAMCO）」，现由沙乌地阿拉伯政府控制，并改名为沙乌地阿拉伯国家石油公司。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q268915","articleTitle":"宰赫兰","sourceRevision":91818668,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 宰赫兰","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%B0%E8%B5%AB%E5%85%B0"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91818668"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q268915"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159122257","name":"塞卡凱","country":"SAU","lat":30.0,"lon":40.13331,"kind":"city","region":"SA-12","rank":9,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"塞卡凱 · 地点概要","geo":"位于该市，市内并有沙乌地阿拉伯铁路以及经过。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q27469","articleTitle":"塞卡凱","sourceRevision":94471369,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 塞卡凯","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A1%9E%E5%8D%A1%E5%87%B1"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94471369"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27469"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159115897","name":"纳布克","country":"SAU","lat":31.3333,"lon":37.3333,"kind":"city","region":"SA-12","rank":10,"capital":0}]}